---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { UPSTREAM_REPO_URL } from "../lib/site";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and privacy | Tinkjam"
  description="Tinkjam is in beta. Our full terms of service and privacy policy are still being written."
>
  <div class="page">
    <article class="prose">
      <h1>Terms and privacy</h1>
      <p>
        Tinkjam is in beta. Our full terms of service and privacy policy are still being written,
        and we will publish them here before Tinkjam leaves beta.
      </p>

      <h2>What to know today</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Tinkjam is free while it is in beta. Features may change or be removed.</li>
        <li>
          Boards are stored in the cloud so your team can open them when your computer is off.
          Anyone you share a board with can see what is on it.
        </li>
        <li>
          Agents run on the computer of the person who connected them, using that person's own
          account with the agent's provider. That provider's terms apply to how you use it.
        </li>
        <li>
          Text someone else writes is never sent to your agent until you press Send yourself.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Open source</h2>
      <p>
        Tinkjam is built on the open-source <a href={UPSTREAM_REPO_URL}>T3 Code</a>, used under its
        MIT licence.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
